{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/519746-experimental-software-for-play-vampire-the-requiem","id":519746,"title":"Experimental software for play vampire: the requiem","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-19T10:46:18-07:00","id":519746,"title":"Experimental software for play vampire: the requiem","content":"Hi, everyone! I make an experimental software for play vampire: the requiem and world of darkness, So It's run on google hangout and It has one dice roller, one sheet creator and more...<br /> I wanna know if be many people play vampire: the requiem on web and how often they use the God-Machine Chronicle's book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6080-brmcerqueira","name":"brmcerqueira","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T07:54:07-07:00","id":521879,"title":"","content":"I do, we use roll20 for the game and skype for voice. We use vampire 2e (which uses god machine chronicle rules), we have a map of the city and a modified version of damnation city barony rules. I also wrote a program to randomly generate npc's (it is is still being developed but it can generate vampires and shapeshifters atm). The emphasis is on generating motives, personal agenda, assets like allies etc. instead of attributes and disciplines. it just determines which of social, physical and mental traits are primary, secondary etc.<br /> My inspiration doing this was a game called mount&amp;blade with a medieval mod where there would be tons of nobles with small armies and you were playing a sandbox game trying to carve your own small empire. I was originally planning a dark ages setting but we ended up in modern times after discussing with my players. Atm we have only 1 player and 1 st as 2 of my players had to leave due to rl problems (people our age has difficulty finding time).<br /> The game itself is player driven instead of story driven so it has little in the way of solving murders, trying to track rogue ghouls etc. it has more to do with players trying to forge alliances and obtain power. We have massive crossover and several weaker supernaturals (think of changing breed books and second sight books). Full fleldged mages and lupines are generally assumed to be living their own separate existence (after skimming through werewolf2e it is clear they are simply too dangerous to be around, those things are unkillable, i only assume mage2e will be just as dangerous).<br /> I do not use god machine chronicle book, as it is more related to mortals i think, vampires are assumed to be unaware of the existence of god machine.<br /> Hope this helps.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4110-necromter","name":"Necromter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T14:54:46-07:00","id":528117,"title":"","content":"Thank you Necromter, Your informations will be useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6080-brmcerqueira","name":"brmcerqueira","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}